3-p112-s031.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s032","speaker":"narrator","text":"books too.","rects":[{"x":34.583,"y":41.6981,"w":10.0255,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈbʊks ˈtuː./","meaning":"书也。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s032.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s033","speaker":"narrator","text":"Our school has a nice science.","rects":[{"x":20.2126,"y":44.0629,"w":43.1506,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˌaʊə ˈskuːl hæz ə ˈnaɪs ˈsaɪəns./","meaning":"我们的学校科学不错","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s033.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s034","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is very.","rects":[{"x":63.9556,"y":44.0629,"w":23.2503,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ˈveriː./","meaning":"这是非常的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s034.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"5 Every day, I check the noticeboards.","rects":[{"x":17.554,"y":46.4277,"w":37.1791,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈfaɪv ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ, ˌaɪ ˈtʃek ðə ˈnəʊtɪsbɔːdz./","meaning":"每天5，我检查通知板。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s004.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s035","speaker":"narrator","text":"There is often important","rects":[{"x":55.3255,"y":46.4277,"w":23.595,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌðeə ɪz ˈɒfən ɪˈmpɔːtənt/","meaning":"经常有很重要的","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s035.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s036","speaker":"narrator","text":"on them.","rects":[{"x":34.583,"y":48.4176,"w":8.8613,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɒn ˌðem./","meaning":"在他们身上","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s036.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s037","speaker":"narrator","text":"I like to time in the school garden.","rects":[{"x":20.2126,"y":50.7824,"w":46.2447,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈlaɪk tə ˈtaɪm ɪn ðə ˈskuːl ˈgɑːdən./","meaning":"我喜欢在学校花园里的时间。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s037.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is a beautiful place.","rects":[{"x":67.0497,"y":50.7824,"w":20.5092,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ə ˈbjuːtɪfʊl ˈpleɪs./","meaning":"这是一个美丽的地方。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s005.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"Complete the diary entry with the correct pronouns.","rects":[{"x":67.1754,"y":57.0298,"w":21.7474,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":59.0192,"w":23.1591,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/kəˈmpliːt ðə ˈdaɪəriː ˈentriː wɪð ðə kəˈrekt ˈprəʊnaʊnz./","meaning":"以正确的代词完成日记条目。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s007.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"A2 Nora is writing a diary entry about her friends at school.","rects":[{"x":14.181,"y":57.0298,"w":52.5395,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ ˈtuː ˈnɔːrə ɪz ˈraɪtɪŋ ə ˈdaɪəriː ˈentriː əˈbaʊt hɜː ˈfrendz æt ˈskuːl./","meaning":"A2 Nora正在写一本关于她在学校的朋友的日记","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s006.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s038","speaker":"narrator","text":"September","rects":[{"x":25.1896,"y":64.1625,"w":10.0729,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/seˈptembə/","meaning":"九月","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s038.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s039","speaker":"narrator","text":"Dear Diary, At school, have two good friends.","rects":[{"x":22.2276,"y":66.9037,"w":10.8014,"h":1.7375},{"x":22.2276,"y":69.571,"w":49.0385,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈdɪə ˈdaɪəriː, ˌæt ˈskuːl, hæv ˈtuː ˈgʊd ˈfrendz./","meaning":"亲爱的日记，在学校，有两个好朋友。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s039.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"Sandy likes art.","rects":[{"x":71.8585,"y":69.6449,"w":14.5005,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈsændiː ˈlaɪks ˈɑːt./","meaning":"桑迪喜欢艺术","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s008.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s041","speaker":"narrator","text":"often paints in the art room.","rects":[{"x":39.037,"y":71.6343,"w":27.4839,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈɒfən ˈpeɪnts ɪn ðiː ˈɑːt ˈruːm./","meaning":"经常在艺术室里画画","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s041.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s042","speaker":"narrator","text":"is a","rects":