ɪŋ ˈhɔːl./","meaning":"喜欢一起吃午饭在餐厅。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s047.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s048","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is a great place for","rects":[{"x":52.1049,"y":83.0108,"w":36.2245,"h":1.812}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ə ˈgreɪt ˈpleɪs fɔː/","meaning":"这是一个伟大的地方","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s048.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s049","speaker":"narrator","text":"to chat.","rects":[{"x":22.2278,"y":85.0747,"w":7.3442,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/tə ˈtʃæt./","meaning":"来聊天。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s049.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s050","speaker":"narrator","text":"are really nice!","rects":[{"x":55.8758,"y":87.8153,"w":13.9783,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ɑː ˈrɪəliː ˈnaɪs!/","meaning":"真不错！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s050.wav"},{"id":"u13-p112-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"I like my friends.","rects":[{"x":22.2278,"y":87.8158,"w":16.2467,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈlaɪk maɪ ˈfrendz./","meaning":"我喜欢我的朋友。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p112-s011.wav"}]},{"page":113,"pdfPage":114,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-113.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u13-p113-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 3","rects":[{"x":84.4168,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈθriː/","meaning":"第3单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p113-s016.wav"},{"id":"u13-p113-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"B Open day","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":6.4851,"w":17.6344,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈəʊpən ˈdeɪ/","meaning":"B 开放日","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p113-s017.wav"},{"id":"u13-p113-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Listen to their conversation and fill in the blanks below.","rects":[{"x":61.065,"y":10.2356,"w":27.4464,"h":2.0721},{"x":12.0052,"y":12.225,"w":19.9935,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈlɪsən tə ðeə ˌkɒnvəˈseɪʃən ænd ˈfɪl ˈɪn ðə ˈblæŋks bɪˈləʊ./","meaning":"听听他们的谈话 并填上下面的空白。","voice":"英式