t":"Read it with him and answer the questions below.","rects":[{"x":71.7712,"y":10.2356,"w":18.1664,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":12.225,"w":24.8035,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈriːd ɪt wɪð ˌhɪm ænd ˈɑːnsə ðə ˈkwestʃənz bɪˈləʊ./","meaning":"和他一起阅读，回答下面的问题。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s002.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"C1 David is reading an article about one student’s dream school.","rects":[{"x":14.3627,"y":10.2356,"w":56.9537,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈwʌn ˈdeɪvɪd ɪz ˈriːdɪŋ ən ˈɑːtɪkəl əˈbaʊt ˈwʌn ˈstjuːdnts ˈdriːm ˈskuːl./","meaning":"C1David正在读一篇关于一个学生梦想学校的文章。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s001.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"My dream school","rects":[{"x":41.6238,"y":17.9137,"w":22.338,"h":2.2188}],"ipa":"/ˌmaɪ ˈdriːm ˈskuːl/","meaning":"我的梦幻学校","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s023.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"My dream school is modern and bright.","rects":[{"x":19.149,"y":20.7059,"w":38.24,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌmaɪ ˈdriːm ˈskuːl ɪz ˈmɒdən ænd ˈbraɪt./","meaning":"我的梦幻学校是现代的和光明的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s003.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"It has many tall buildings and smart classrooms.","rects":[{"x":57.9814,"y":20.7059,"w":24.6519,"h":1.7375},{"x":19.149,"y":22.6958,"w":21.2378,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt hæz ˈmeniː ˈtɔːl ˈbɪldɪŋz ænd ˈsmɑːt ˈklɑːsruːmz./","meaning":"它拥有许多高大的建筑和智能教室。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s004.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"The school has a big library with many floors.","rects":[{"x":19.149,"y":25.437,"w":44.1657,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈskuːl hæz ə ˈbɪg ˈlaɪbrəriː wɪð ˈmeniː ˈflɔːz./","meaning":"学校拥有一个拥有许多楼层的大型图书馆。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s005.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"We can read different kinds of books in it.","rects":[{"x":63.9071,"y":25.437,"w":20.6244,"h":1.7375},{"x":19.149,"y":27.4268,"w":19.1572,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː kæn ˈriːd ˈdɪfərənt ˈkaɪndz ɒv ˈbʊks ɪn ɪt./","meaning":"我们可以在书里读各种书。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s006.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is a building with many glass walls.","rects":[{"x":81.2348,"y":27.4268,"w":5.1995,"h":1.7375},{"x":19.149,"y":29.4167,"w":30.2085,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ə ˈbɪldɪŋ wɪð ˈmeniː ˈglɑːs ˈwɔːlz./","meaning":"它是一座有许多玻璃墙的建筑。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s008.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"There is also a cool art centre in the school.","rects":[{"x":38.8985,"y":27.4268,"w":41.7439,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌðeə ɪz ˈɔːlsəʊ ə ˈkuːl ˈɑːt ˈsentə ɪn ðə ˈskuːl./","meaning":"学校内还设有一个凉爽的艺术中心。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s007.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"We have lots of clubs and after-school activities there.","rects":[{"x":49.9457,"y":29.4167,"w":36.4347,"h":1.7375},{"x":19.149,"y":31.4066,"w":14.6553,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː hæv ˈlɒts ɒv ˈklʌbz ænd ˌɑːftəˈskuːl æˈktɪvɪtiːz ˈðeə./","meaning":"我们在那里有很多俱乐部和课后活动。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s009.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"Outside, there are also two football fields and a large playground.","rects":[{"x":19.149,"y":34.1478,"w":62.7443,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaʊˈtsaɪd, ðeə ɑː ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈtuː ˈfʊtbɔːl ˈfiːldz ænd ə ˈlɑːdʒ ˈpleɪgraʊnd./","meaning":"外面还有两个足球场和一个大型的操场。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s010.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"We can play and have great fun.","rects":[{"x":82.4857,"y":34.1478,"w":3.0446,"h":1.7375},{"x":19.149,"y":36.1377,"w":27.3662,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː kæn ˈpleɪ ænd hæv ˈgreɪt ˈfʌn./","meaning":"我们可以玩，玩得很开心。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s011.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"But my favourite part of my dream school is the dining hall.","rects":[{"x":19.149,"y":38.8788,"w":58.0412,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌbʌt maɪ ˈfeɪvərɪt ˈpɑːt ɒv maɪ ˈdriːm ˈskuːl ɪz ðə ˈdaɪnɪŋ ˈhɔːl./","meaning":"但我梦中学校最爱的地方就是餐厅","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s012.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"It has all kinds of healthy food and snacks.","rects":[{"x":77.7826,"y":38.8788,"w":8.2483,"h":1.7375},{"x":19.149,"y":40.8687,"w":32.3449,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt hæz ˈɔːl ˈkaɪndz ɒv ˈhelθiː ˈfuːd ænd ˈsnæks./","meaning":"它有各种健康的食物和小吃。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s013.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"My dream school is the best place to learn and have a good time!","rects":[{"x":19.149,"y":43.6099,"w":62.539,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌmaɪ ˈdriːm ˈskuːl ɪz ðə ˈbest ˈpleɪs tə ˈlɜːn ænd hæv ə ˈgʊd ˈtaɪm!/","meaning":"我的梦幻学校是学习和享受美好时光的最好地方！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s014.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 What is special about the art centre?","rects":[{"x":13.6006,"y":51.0792,"w":37.6703,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ˌwɒt ɪz ˈspeʃl əˈbaʊt ðiː ˈɑːt ˈsentə?/","meaning":"1艺术中心有什么特别？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s015.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"2 Where can students play in this school?","rects":[{"x":13.6006,"y":56.5616,"w":41.0245,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈtuː ˌweə kæn ˈstjuːdnts ˈpleɪ ɪn ðɪs ˈskuːl?/","meaning":"2，学生在该校可以在哪里玩？。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s016.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"3 What does the dream dining hall have?","rects":[{"x":13.6006,"y":62.044,"w":40.6819,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈθriː ˌwɒt ˈdʌz ðə ˈdriːm ˈdaɪnɪŋ ˈhɔːl ˈhæv?/","meaning":"3，梦幻餐厅有什么？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s017.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"You can write about different things, like school buildings, teachers and school activities.","rects":[{"x":67.966,"y":70.6891,"w":17.5244,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":72.6784,"w":58.8751,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˌjuː kæn ˈraɪt əˈbaʊt ˈdɪfərənt ˈθɪŋz, ˈlaɪk ˈskuːl ˈbɪldɪŋz, ˈtiːtʃəz ænd ˈskuːl æˈktɪvɪtiːz./","meaning":"你可以写不同的东西，比如校舍，教师和学校活动。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s020.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s018","speaker":"narrator","text":"C2 What is your dream school like?","rects":[{"x":14.2127,"y":70.6891,"w":31.352,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈtuː ˌwɒt ɪz jɔː ˈdriːm ˈskuːl ˈlaɪk?/","meaning":"C2你的梦幻学校是怎样的？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s018.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"Write an article about it.","rects":[{"x":46.0195,"y":70.6891,"w":21.4916,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈraɪt ən ˈɑːtɪkəl əˈbaʊt ɪt./","meaning":"写一篇关于此事的文章。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s019.wav"},{"id":"u13-p114-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"My dream school is","rects":[{"x":15.4255,"y":77.6631,"w":74.5192,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌmaɪ ˈdriːm ˈskuːl ɪz/","meaning":"我的梦想学校是","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u13/u13-p114-s024.wav"}]}]}